.TH tokenizer_peek_token 3
.SH NAME
tokenizer_peek_token \- look ahead at the next token
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "tokenizer.h"
.PP
.BI "int tokenizer_peek_token(tokenizer *" t ", token *" tok ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tokenizer_peek_token
parses the next token and stores it in
.I tok
without advancing the tokenizer's read position. Subsequent calls to
.BR tokenizer_next (3)
will return this same token.